The product_logo images are the unbranded Chromium logo (not the Google
Chrome trademarked logo); they are used as the prompt's window and taskbar
icon so that it groups with Chromium during troubleshooting.

The .icon files are the illustration Chromium shows in its own security key
PIN and touch prompts. passkey_usb.png and passkey_usb_dark.png are those two
files rendered at their native size of 316 x 112 pixels; they are derived
works under the same licence.

The Linux prompt embeds the four PNG files: the Swift Package Manager compiles
them into the executable (the embedInCode resources in ../../Package.swift),
so the tool is a single file without resource files next to it.

The dialogs are phido2 windows, not Chromium windows.
